          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: सत्कर्म",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सत्कर्म — satkarma — \"a virtuous act\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सेवा सत्कर्म अस्ति। sevā satkarma asti. Service is a virtuous act."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सत्कर्म (satkarma) is built from sat, \"good\", and karman, \"an act\", from the root √kṛ; MW gives sat-karman \"a good work, a virtuous act\" (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
